# Intent: Owner decision 22: a camera switch on the quick actions. The action "vision" turns the camera off and on through the unit's vision-off privacy state; it replaces Games in the default four actions (Games stays on the Games page and in More). It works in full quiet and under a mute: it makes no sound and moves nothing. A unit that saved its own list of actions keeps it.
# Placement: unit
# Upstream: firmware/main/hal (ours)
# Check after a flash: the Quick actions page shows Beep, Dance, Camera and Say hi; one tap on Camera reports vision_off true in self.privacy state and a second tap false; self.pages.set_config accepts vision in actions.
# Kconfig: none
# Memory cost: none (one action id and a title).

